nty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 195% of normal in April to May and 25% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 43% of normal. On grid 19358 the driest year was 1963, at 57% of normal.</p>"}
